${_h4}`:_h4,X=D?"The user has already told you what they want (see User Request at the bottom). Skip the initial question and go directly to the matching workflow.":`Your FIRST action must be a single ${bz} tool call (no preamble). Use this EXACT string for the \`question\` field \u2014 do not paraphrase or shorten it:

